Jap Version = [LV1][LV2][LV3] (When Summoned) Put a core from the Void to a Spirit you control.
{{!}}-{{!}}
Eng Version = [LV1][LV2][LV3] (When Summoned) Gain 1 core on target spirit you control.
}}

{{Tribute|Cost 3 or more &rarr; Void}}
After paying for the summoning cost, you must send all cores from a Cost 3 or more Spirit you control to the Void.

[LV1][LV2][LV3]
The attacks of Cost 4 or less Spirits can't reduce either player's Life.

[LV2][LV3] {{Armor|Red/Purple/White/Blue}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red/Purple/White/Blue Spirit/Nexus/Magic effects.
